//! The `caption-side` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property puts the
//! content of a table's `caption` on the specified side. The values are relative to the
//! `writing-mode` of the table.
//!
//! Initial: top. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - bottom: The caption box should be positioned at the block end side of the table.
//! - top: The caption box should be positioned at the block start side of the table.
//!
//! Grammar: top | bottom
